{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sfec29b4419c8a601","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-26e9c81f0101b4197538","text":"又见面了，「开拓」的小灰鸟♭","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ea61a3322c280fd2f056","text":"你又把我吵醒了呀","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-705e006694b3230dd7e7","text":"醒醒！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e5b1e1a82a777c998e6b","text":"醒醒——","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5adcf70162aad1d86dee","text":"新衣服到了，星探找上门了，你最爱的果汁和知更鸟联名了——","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-81cce013e49d692b3fcd","text":"你在梦游？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cf88adfe1745f82516a8","text":"现在几点就开始梦游啦？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9da51921d69f5aaade34","text":"朋友，记得切号","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-01a865a3e9205eed3803","text":"朋友，记得切号","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-26640435a8e2aab7a918","text":"现在可是夜晚时间","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6cf166b7dc969b3ec13a","text":"我只是来与你做个小交易","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-43c1cf443b0d80a01330","text":"你还有一些…「记忆」在我手里，你不会希望它们被公之于众吧？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-53353eb35d8b40fd6b80","text":"那就展开讲讲吧","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9964d56b9d809c1721b6","text":"身正不怕影子斜","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-94299490337f909bb141","text":"我身正不怕影子斜","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a1c265a4e77a7ff42509","text":"你尾随失恋的大地兽，又趁它不注意，与它合影，留下一张智者不入爱河的自拍","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cb43834b43b4469f3208","text":"你在路边的祭司那儿算命，在摊前留下一张我命由我不由天的自拍","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-86915e5964ebe235c808","text":"你出门散步，偶遇吟游的诗人…当场来了一段说唱，并留下一张自拍","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-24613758aba2eeffc00d","text":"早上头发乱糟糟的时候，你留下一张自拍","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-68a30835f9bfecffc7ca","text":"感觉最近吃胖了，你留下一张自拍","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-969d5a9711613345c349","text":"停停停停","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bce811456f8c7395190b","text":"好了，看来我们需要一点「忘却」的力量","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-641e0ae40904a9aff02a","text":"这都是为了三月七","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-642cfd1fd2ac5f5853ad","text":"唉，本想默默付出，还是被发现了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-49b376559c4c14da526f","text":"这都是为了三月七拍的照片","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-98bdeff64ac1c7b9112b","text":"说吧，要我怎么做，才能把这些「记忆」还给我","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-9807970fae07be8c10bd","text":"嘻，她现在都知道啦♭","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-43bd728b9d2e48639060","text":"如果不想在照片墙上看到这些的话…很简单，小灰鸟♭","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5b63e331df8de4473f2b","text":"我要她明天中午醒来后，就能看见眼前新鲜出炉的美食","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ed0d83d1e97594a369fb","text":"梦里可以许愿","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-99bfd0248381cef7ee46","text":"睡吧，三月七，梦里可以许愿","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-14d9689fb3b747006e17","text":"好的，长夜月","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e7c69ee737915545f4e7","text":"好的，长夜月","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-657ae3d193a56e78a37d","text":"算啦，不和你玩啦","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-507350f953585d43d7ed","text":"肚子饿了，快想想等会吃什么吧","speaker":"三月七"}]}
